---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Endonautas — Agenda, fichas clínicas y tests para tu consulta"
  description="Software para terapeutas, coaches y acompañantes: agenda con disponibilidad, fichas clínicas, notas de sesión y 35 tests validados que asignas y llegan corregidos. Tus clientes trabajan entre sesiones. $39.990 al mes, sin cobro por cliente."
  cosmosScroll={true}
>
<script slot="head" type="application/ld+json" is:inline>{JSON.stringify({
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "¿Mis clientes tienen que pagar algo?",
      "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "No. El terapeuta paga su plan e invita a sus clientes con un código: ellos se registran gratis y acceden al Espejo IA diario, su bitácora y los tests asignados. No hay cobro por cliente ni límite de cuántos se invitan." }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "¿Tengo que migrar mis fichas actuales?",
      "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "No. Se empieza con el próximo cliente que se agende y se sigue igual con el resto. No hay migración obligatoria ni importación que configurar." }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "¿Qué ve el terapeuta del proceso de su cliente y qué queda privado?",
      "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "El terapeuta ve los resultados de los tests que asignó, la ficha clínica, sus notas de sesión y la agenda. Las conversaciones del cliente con el Espejo IA y su bitácora personal son privadas y no las lee el terapeuta." }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "¿Los tests tienen respaldo real?",
      "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Son 35 instrumentos validados en español: PHQ-9, GAD-7, Big Five, ECR, DERS, entre otros. Se asignan desde la ficha del cliente y el resultado llega puntuado. El Oráculo y los mapas de nacimiento no son instrumentos clínicos ni diagnóstico." }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "¿Y si no funciona para mi forma de trabajar?",
      "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Hay 30 días de garantía: si en ese plazo decides que no es para ti, escribes a hola@endonautas.cl desde el correo de tu cuenta y se devuelve el 100% de lo pagado, sin preguntas ni formularios. Pasados los 30 días puedes cancelar cuando quieras y no se vuelve a cobrar; la cuenta no se borra, vuelve al plan gratuito y las fichas, notas y clientes quedan donde estaban." }
    }
  ]
})}</script>
<style>
/* ── LANDING: .s override ── */
.s {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 17vh 0;
  overflow: hidden;
}
/* ── HERO ── */
#inicio {
  min-height: 100vh;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: stretch;
  flex-direction: column;
}
.hero-wrap {
  padding: 0 7%;
  width: 100%;
  text-align: right;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
}
.hero-wrap::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  inset: -12vh -8vw;
  background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 80% 46%, rgba(3,3,6,.80) 0%, rgba(3,3,6,.45) 45%, transparent 72%);
  z-index: -1;
  pointer-events: none;
}
.hero-sup {
  color: var(--c);
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
  text-shadow: var(--ts);
  opacity: 0;
  animation: fadeUp .7s .1s forwards;
}
.hero-h {
  font-family: var(--fd);
  font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 5.8vw, 5.2rem);
  line-height: 1.08;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: -.04em;
  color: #fff;
  text-shadow: var(--ts);
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
}
.hero-pero { color: rgba(255,255,255,.28); font-weight: 300; }
.word {
  display: inline-block;
  opacity: 0;
  animation: wordIn .65s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) forwards;
  animation-delay: calc(.3s + var(--i) * .09s);
}
.hero-sub {
  font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.9vw, 1.28rem);
  color: var(--mut);
  max-width: 500px;
  margin: 0 0 2.2rem auto;
  line-height: 1.78;
  text-shadow: var(--ts);
  opacity: 0;
  animation: fadeUp .8s 1.1s forwards;
  font-weight: 400;
  text-align: right;
}
.hero-sub strong { color: rgba(255,255,255,.9); font-weight: 500; }
.hero-cta {
  opacity: 0;
  animation: fadeUp .8s 1.4s forwards;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: flex-end;
  gap: 1.4rem;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.hero-note {
  font-size: .8rem;
  color: var(--dim);
  margin-top: 1.6rem;
  letter-spacing: .03em;
  opacity: 0;
  animation: fadeUp .8s 1.7s forwards;
  text-align: right;
}
/* ── RECONOCIMIENTO ── */
#reconoc { flex-direction: column; }
.reconoc-intro {
  font-family: var(--fd);
  font-weight: 300;
  font-size: clamp(.85rem, 1.2vw, 1rem);
  color: var(--dim);
  margin-bottom: 6rem;
  padding: 0 7%;
  text-shadow: var(--ts);
  letter-spacing: .05em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}
.reconoc-items { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8vh; width: 100%; }
.q-item { max-width: min(640px, 55vw); position: relative; z-index: 1; }
.q-item::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  inset: -2.5rem -5vw;
  background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 30% 50%, rgba(3,3,6,.64) 0%, transparent 70%);
  z-index: -1;
  pointer-events: none;
}
.q-item.qr::before {
  background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 70% 50%, rgba(3,3,6,.64) 0%, transparent 70%);
}
.q-item.ql { align-self: flex-start; padding-left: 8vw; }
.q-item.qr { align-self: flex-end; padding-right: 8vw; }
.q-text {
  font-family: var(--fd);
  font-weight: 300;
  font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.9vw, 2.2rem);
  color: rgba(255,255,255,.82);
  line-height: 1.38;
  text-shadow: var(--ts);
}
.q-attr {
  display: block;
  margin-top: .8rem;
  font-size: .8rem;
  color: var(--dim);
  letter-spacing: .04em;
  font-style: italic;
}
.q-item.qr .q-text, .q-item.qr .q-attr { text-align: right; }
.reconoc-res {
  align-self: center;
  text-align: center;
  margin-top: 6vh;
  padding: 0 7%;
  font-family: var(--fd);
  font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.8vw, 1.2rem);
  font-weight: 400;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,.80);
  line-height: 1.68;
  letter-spacing: -.01em;
  text-shadow: var(--ts);
}
.reconoc-res em { color: var(--c); font-style: normal; }
/* ── DIFERENCIA ── */
#dif { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
.dif-h {
  font-family: var(--fd);
  font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.8vw, 2.1rem);
  font-weight: 300;
  color: #fff;
  max-width: 480px;
  line-height: 1.3;
  margin-bottom: 4.5rem;
  text-shadow: var(--ts);
}
.versus { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1px 1fr; width: 100%; }
.v-col { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3.5rem; padding: 0 4rem; }
.v-col:first-child { padding-left: 0; }
.v-col:last-child { padding-right: 0; }
.v-sep {
  background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,.05) 15%, var(--c) 50%, rgba(255,255,255,.05) 85%, transparent);
}
.v-lbl { color: var(--dim); margin-bottom: .5rem; font-size: .75rem; letter-spacing: .1em; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; }
.v-lbl-c { color: var(--c); }
.v-old { font-size: .97rem; color: var(--mut); line-height: 1.75; font-style: italic; }
.v-new { font-family: var(--fd); font-weight: 300; font-size: 1.05rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,.88); line-height: 1.7; }
.v-acc { color: var(--c); }
/* ── INSTRUMENTOS ── */
#incluye { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
.inst-h { font-family: var(--fd); font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.8vw, 2.1rem); font-weight: 300; color: #fff; margin-bottom: .7rem; text-shadow: var(--ts); }
.inst-sub { color: var(--dim); font-size: .88rem; margin-bottom: 4.5rem; }
.inst-body {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 300px;
  gap: 6rem;
  width: 100%;
  align-items: start;
}
.inst-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
.inst-item {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 42px 1fr;
  gap: 1.8rem;
  padding: 2rem 0;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--bdr);
  align-items: start;
}
.inst-item:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--bdr); }
.inst-n {
  font-family: var(--fd);
  font-size: 1.4rem;
  font-weight: 300;
  color: var(--dim);
  line-height: 1;
  text-align: right;
  padding-top: .15rem;
}
.inst-name { font-family: var(--fd); font-weight: 600; color: #fff; margin-bottom: .35rem; font-size: 1rem; }
.inst-desc { font-size: .92rem; color: var(--mut); line-height: 1.68; }
.inst-visual { position: sticky; top: 5rem; }
.img-stack { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.6rem; }
.img-stack-a, .img-stack-b, .img-stack-c {
  border-radius: 10px;
  overflow: hidden;
  box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.72), 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.07);
  width: 120%;
  margin-left: -10%;
  aspect-ratio: 3/2;
}
.img-stack-a { transform: rotate(-1.8deg); }
.img-stack-b { transform: rotate(1.4deg) translateX(4%); }
.img-stack-c { transform: rotate(-0.8deg); }
.img-stack-a img, .img-stack-b img, .img-stack-c img {
  width: 100%; height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover; object-position: center;
  display: block;
  filter: brightness(.84) saturate(.72);
}
.inst-cta { margin-top: 3.2rem; }
/* ── FRANCO ── */
#franco { flex-direction: column; }
.franco-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 500px 1fr;
  gap: 7rem;
  width: 100%;
  align-items: start;
}
.franco-images {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: .6rem;
  height: 540px;
}
.fi-foto, .fi-libro { overflow: hidden; border-radius: 6px; }
.fi-foto img {
  width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block;
  object-fit: cover; object-position: left top;
  filter: grayscale(100%) contrast(1.08);
  transition: filter .6s cubic-bezier(.25,.8,.25,1);
}
.fi-foto:hover img { filter: grayscale(0%) contrast(1); }
.fi-libro img { width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; object-fit: cover; object-position: center top; }
.franco-texto {
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2.4rem; padding-top: .5rem;
  position: relative; z-index: 1;
}
.franco-texto::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  inset: -3rem -4rem;
  background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 40% 30%, rgba(3,3,6,.55) 0%, transparent 68%);
  z-index: -1;
  pointer-events: none;
}
.franco-q {
  font-family: var(--fd); font-weight: 300;
  font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.2vw, 1.75rem);
  color: rgba(255,255,255,.84); line-height: 1.48;
  text-shadow: var(--ts);
  border-left: 2px solid var(--c); padding-left: 1.6rem;
}
.franco-id { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .3rem; }
.franco-name { font-family: var(--fd); font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
.franco-role { font-size: .75rem; color: var(--c); letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 600; }
.franco-bio { font-size: .96rem; color: var(--mut); line-height: 1.82; max-width: 460px; }
.libro-inc {
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .8rem;
  font-size: .8rem; color: var(--dim); padding: .9rem 1.1rem;
  border: 1px solid var(--bdr); border-radius: 8px;
  width: fit-content; background: rgba(10,8,20,.45);
}
.libro-inc span { color: var(--c); font-weight: 600; }
.franco-ctas { display: flex; gap: .8rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
/* ── GALERÍA 3D CARRUSEL ── */
#preview { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; gap: 0; padding-bottom: 10vh; }
.gallery-scene {
  width: 100%;
  padding: 3rem 0 4rem;
  overflow: hidden;
  cursor: ew-resize;
  user-select: none;
}
.gallery-hint {
  text-align: center;
  font-size: .7rem;
  letter-spacing: .1em;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,.25);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
}
.gallery-track {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 18px;
  will-change: transform;
  /* JS posiciona con translateX */
}
.gc {
  flex-shrink: 0;
  width: clamp(260px, 26vw, 360px);
  border-radius: 10px;
  overflow: hidden;
  box-shadow: 0 18px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.75), 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.07);
  position: relative;
  will-change: transform, opacity;
  cursor: zoom-in;
}
.gc img {
  width: 100%; height: auto;
  aspect-ratio: 16/10;
  object-fit: cover;
  object-position: top left;
  display: block;
  pointer-events: none;
}
.gc-label {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
  padding: .5rem .75rem;
  background: linear-gradient(transparent, rgba(0,0,0,.88));
  font-size: .64rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: .1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: rgba(126,204,205,.85);
  transition: opacity .25s;
}
/* Mobile: grid estático */
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .gallery-scene { cursor: default; padding: 1.5rem 5%; overflow: visible; }
  .gallery-hint { display: none; }
  .gallery-track { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .9rem; transform: none !important; }
  .gc { width: calc(50% - .45rem); transform: none !important; opacity: 1 !important; cursor: zoom-in; }
  .gc:nth-child(5) { width: 100%; }
}
/* ── LIGHTBOX ── */
#lb {
  position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 9000;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  background: rgba(0,0,0,0); backdrop-filter: blur(0px);
  transition: background .25s, backdrop-filter .25s, opacity .25s;
  pointer-events: none; opacity: 0;
}
#lb.open {
  background: rgba(0,0,0,.93); backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  pointer-events: auto; opacity: 1;
}
#lb-img {
  max-width: 88vw; max-height: 86vh;
  border-radius: 10px;
  box-shadow: 0 40px 120px rgba(0,0,0,.9);
  transform: scale(.93);
  transition: transform .3s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1), opacity .2s;
  display: block;
  pointer-events: none;
}
#lb.open #lb-img { transform: scale(1); }
#lb-close {
  position: absolute; top: 1.1rem; right: 1.4rem;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,.5); font-size: 1.8rem; line-height: 1;
  cursor: pointer; user-select: none; transition: color .18s;
}
#lb-close:hover { color: #fff; }
.lb-nav {
  position: absolute; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%);
  background: rgba(255,255,255,.08); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);
  color: rgba(255,255,255,.7); font-size: 1.6rem; line-height: 1;
  width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 50%;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  cursor: pointer; transition: background .18s, color .18s;
  user-select: none;
}
.lb-nav:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,.18); color: #fff; }
#lb-prev { left: 1.2rem; }
#lb-next { right: 1.2rem; }
#lb-dots {
  position: absolute; bottom: 1.1rem; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
  display: flex; gap: .45rem;
}
.lb-dot {
  width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,.25); transition: background .2s;
}
.lb-dot.active { background: #7ecccd; }
/* ── PRECIOS ── */
#precios { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
.precios-h { font-family: var(--fd); font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.8vw, 2.1rem); font-weight: 300; color: #fff; margin-bottom: .6rem; text-shadow: var(--ts); }
.precios-sub { color: var(--dim); font-size: .9rem; margin-bottom: 4rem; }
.planes-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1.4rem; width: 100%; }
.plan {
  border: 1px solid var(--bdr); border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 2.4rem 2rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.8rem;
  background: rgba(10,8,20,.55); backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  transition: border-color .22s; position: relative;
}
.plan:hover { border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.15); }
.plan.featured { border-color: rgba(126,204,205,.35); background: rgba(126,204,205,.05); }
.plan-badge {
  position: absolute; top: -1px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
  background: var(--c); color: #020909;
  font-family: var(--fd); font-size: .62rem; font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase;
  padding: .3rem .9rem; border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;
}
.plan-name { font-family: var(--fd); font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--dim); }
.plan-price { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: .3rem; }
.plan-amount { font-family: var(--fd); font-size: 2.8rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; letter-spacing: -.04em; line-height: 1; }
.plan-period { font-size: .82rem; color: var(--dim); }
.plan-divider { height: 1px; background: var(--bdr); }
.plan-feats { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .85rem; list-style: none; flex: 1; }
.plan-feats li { font-size: .9rem; color: var(--mut); line-height: 1.5; display: flex; gap: .55rem; align-items: baseline; }
.plan-feats li::before { content: '·'; color: var(--c); flex-shrink: 0; }
.plan-feats li.hi { color: rgba(255,255,255,.88); }
.plan-cta { margin-top: auto; }
.plan-cta .btn { width: 100%; }
.plan-note { font-size: .74rem; color: var(--dim); text-align: center; margin-top: .6rem; }
/* ── FAQ ── */
#faq { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
.faq-h { font-family: var(--fd); font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2.4vw, 1.75rem); font-weight: 300; color: #fff; text-shadow: var(--ts); margin-bottom: 3.5rem; }
.faq-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; width: 100%; max-width: 760px; }
.faq-item { border-top: 1px solid var(--bdr); padding: 1.8rem 0; cursor: pointer; }
.faq-item:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--bdr); }
.faq-q {
  display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 1.5rem;
  font-family: var(--fd); font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 500;
  color: rgba(255,255,255,.85); line-height: 1.4; user-select: none;
}
.faq-icon { flex-shrink: 0; width: 16px; height: 16px; color: var(--c); transition: transform .25s; }
.faq-item.open .faq-icon { transform: rotate(45deg); }
.faq-a {
  font-size: .92rem; color: var(--mut); line-height: 1.8;
  max-height: 0; overflow: hidden;
  transition: max-height .35s ease, padding .35s ease;
}
.faq-item.open .faq-a { max-height: 260px; padding-top: 1rem; }
/* ── NEWSLETTER / EMAIL CAPTURE ── */
#newsletter { flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
.nl-wrap { max-width: 560px; width: 100%; text-align: center; }
.nl-lbl { color: var(--c); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
.nl-h { font-family: var(--fd); font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.8vw, 2.1rem); font-weight: 300; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 1rem; text-shadow: var(--ts); }
.nl-sub { font-size: .9rem; color: var(--dim); line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
.nl-form { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: .75rem; width: 100%; }
.nl-input-wrap { display: flex; width: 100%; gap: .5rem; }
.nl-input {
  flex: 1; background: rgba(255,255,255,.05); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);
  border-radius: 8px; padding: .75rem 1rem; color: #fff; font-size: .92rem;
  outline: none; transition: border-color .2s;
}
.nl-input::placeholder { color: rgba(255,255,255,.3); }
.nl-input:focus { border-color: var(--c); }
.nl-btn { white-space: nowrap; flex-shrink: 0; }
.nl-note { font-size: .72rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,.25); }
.nl-msg { font-size: .82rem; min-height: 1.2em; }
.nl-msg.err { color: #e05050; }
.nl-success { font-size: 1rem; color: var(--c); font-family: var(--fd); padding: 1.5rem 0; }
@media (max-width: 600px) {
  .nl-input-wrap { flex-direction: column; }
  .nl-btn { width: 100%; }
}
/* ── MOBILE ── */
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .s { padding: 12vh 0; }
  .inst-body { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .inst-visual { display: none; }
  .franco-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 3rem; }
  .franco-images { height: 300px; }
  .planes-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; max-width: 380px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .versus { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 3rem; }
  .v-sep { display: none; }
  .v-col { padding: 0; }
  .q-item { max-width: 90vw; }
  .q-item.qr { text-align: left; }
  .q-item.qr .q-text, .q-item.qr .q-attr { text-align: left; }
  .hero-cta { flex-direction: column; }
}
</style>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="s s-full" id="inicio">
